{
    "en": {
        "Goku": "Goku",
        "And so he left, hungry for more.": "And so he left, hungry for more.",
        "Default": "Default",
        "Goku Black": "Goku Black",
        "Drip": "Drip",
        "Saiyan Blood": "Saiyan Blood",
        "Skills also require <color=#03bcff>Ki</color> to be used!\nPerform a <color=#FF5400>Main Transformation</color> by tapping <color=#03f4fc>C</color> (View Transformations Tab for more info).\nPerform a <color=#FF5400>Kaioken Transformation</color> by holding <color=#03f4fc>C</color>.\n<color=#FF5400>Power down</color> by tapping <color=#03f4fc>X</color>.\n<color=#FF5400>Fly</color> by holding <color=#03f4fc>Jump</color>.": "Skills also require <color=#03bcff>Ki</color> to be used!\nPerform a <color=#FF5400>Main Transformation</color> by tapping <color=#03f4fc>C</color> (View Transformations Tab for more info).\nPerform a <color=#FF5400>Kaioken Transformation</color> by holding <color=#03f4fc>C</color>.\n<color=#FF5400>Power down</color> by tapping <color=#03f4fc>X</color>.\n<color=#FF5400>Fly</color> by holding <color=#03f4fc>Jump</color>.",
        "Melee Strike": "Melee Strike",
        "Deal <color=#E5C962>280% Damage</color> each strike!\nGain <color=#03bcff>9% Ki</color> Per Hit!\n<color=#03f4fc>Auto-moves to targeted enemies.</color>\n<color=#03f4fc>Teleports instead if </color><color=#FF5400>Kaioken</color><color=#03f4fc> is active!</color>": "Deal <color=#E5C962>280% Damage</color> each strike!\nGain <color=#03bcff>9% Ki</color> Per Hit!\n<color=#03f4fc>Auto-moves to targeted enemies.</color>\n<color=#03f4fc>Teleports instead if </color><color=#FF5400>Kaioken</color><color=#03f4fc> is active!</color>",
        "Triple Kick (Legacy)": "Triple Kick (Legacy)",
        "Unleashes a trio of kicks! \nDealing <color=#E5C962>260% Damage</color> each!\nGain <color=#03bcff>5% Ki</color> Per Hit!": "Unleashes a trio of kicks! \nDealing <color=#E5C962>260% Damage</color> each!\nGain <color=#03bcff>5% Ki</color> Per Hit!",
        "Ki Blast": "Ki Blast",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>6 Ki</color>\nFire off a speedy Ki Blast! \n<color=#03f4fc>Holding this skill fires an additional blast </color>\nDealing <color=#E5C962>350% Damage</color> for each one!\n": "Costs <color=#03bcff>6 Ki</color>\nFire off a speedy Ki Blast! \n<color=#03f4fc>Holding this skill fires an additional blast </color>\nDealing <color=#E5C962>350% Damage</color> for each one!\n",
        "Meteor Crash": "Meteor Crash",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>20 Ki</color>\nRapidly unleash a barrage of strikes! \nDealing <color=#E5C962>340% Damage</color> for each one!\n<color=#03f4fc>Holding this skill drains </color><color=#03bcff>10% Ki </color><color=#03f4fc>per second.</color>": "Costs <color=#03bcff>20 Ki</color>\nRapidly unleash a barrage of strikes! \nDealing <color=#E5C962>340% Damage</color> for each one!\n<color=#03f4fc>Holding this skill drains </color><color=#03bcff>10% Ki </color><color=#03f4fc>per second.</color>",
        "Instant Transmission": "Instant Transmission",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>25 Ki</color>\nFocus on your target and teleport!\n<color=#03f4fc>Distance is limited if there is no target</color>": "Costs <color=#03bcff>25 Ki</color>\nFocus on your target and teleport!\n<color=#03f4fc>Distance is limited if there is no target</color>",
        "Ki Charge": "Ki Charge",
        "Hold and Regenerate <color=#03bcff>20% Ki</color> Per Second\n<color=#03f4fc>Mitigates strain, allowing for extended Kaioken usage.</color>": "Hold and Regenerate <color=#03bcff>20% Ki</color> Per Second\n<color=#03f4fc>Mitigates strain, allowing for extended Kaioken usage.</color>",
        "Kamehameha": "Kamehameha",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>30 Ki</color>\nCharge and unleash a Kamehameha, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1200% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active! \nConsume additional Ki and increase damage by <color=#E5C962>1000% Damage</color> per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>": "Costs <color=#03bcff>30 Ki</color>\nCharge and unleash a Kamehameha, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1200% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active! \nConsume additional Ki and increase damage by <color=#E5C962>1000% Damage</color> per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>",
        "Spirit Bomb": "Spirit Bomb",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>200 Ki</color>\nCharge and unleash a Spirit Bomb, Dealing <color=#E5C962>400% Damage</color> per 0.3 seconds to enemies within it! \nConsume additional Ki and increase overall damage by <color=#E5C962>1200% Damage</color> per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>\n\n<color=#03f4fc>If the Spirit Bomb collides with a boss or the ground, it will explode, Dealing </color><color=#E5C962>4000% Damage</color>\n<color=#999999>Gain Bonus Armor whilst standing still.</color>\n<color=#FF0000>Whilst moving the Spirit Bomb will not charge!</color>": "Costs <color=#03bcff>200 Ki</color>\nCharge and unleash a Spirit Bomb, Dealing <color=#E5C962>400% Damage</color> per 0.3 seconds to enemies within it! \nConsume additional Ki and increase overall damage by <color=#E5C962>1200% Damage</color> per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>\n\n<color=#03f4fc>If the Spirit Bomb collides with a boss or the ground, it will explode, Dealing </color><color=#E5C962>4000% Damage</color>\n<color=#999999>Gain Bonus Armor whilst standing still.</color>\n<color=#FF0000>Whilst moving the Spirit Bomb will not charge!</color>",
        "Angry Kamehameha": "Angry Kamehameha",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>60 Ki</color>\nUnleash an Angry Kamehameha, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1550% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!": "Costs <color=#03bcff>60 Ki</color>\nUnleash an Angry Kamehameha, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1550% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!",
        "Ki Blast Barrage": "Ki Blast Barrage",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>80 Ki</color>\nUnleash an Barrage of Ki Blasts, Dealing <color=#E5C962>205% Damage</color> with each one!": "Costs <color=#03bcff>80 Ki</color>\nUnleash an Barrage of Ki Blasts, Dealing <color=#E5C962>205% Damage</color> with each one!",
        "Dragon Fist": "Dragon Fist",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>225 Ki</color>\nCharge forward and unleash a Fiery Dragon Fist, Dealing <color=#E5C962>2400% Damage</color> to every enemy hit!\n<color=#03f4fc>Deals bonus damage to low health targets!</color>": "Costs <color=#03bcff>225 Ki</color>\nCharge forward and unleash a Fiery Dragon Fist, Dealing <color=#E5C962>2400% Damage</color> to every enemy hit!\n<color=#03f4fc>Deals bonus damage to low health targets!</color>",
        "God Bind": "God Bind",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>150 Ki</color>\nChannel the Saiyan God's power and deal <color=#E5C962>800% Damage</color> and stun per pulse!\n<color=#03f4fc>Extend the duration at the cost of </color><color=#03bcff>10 Ki per second!</color>": "Costs <color=#03bcff>150 Ki</color>\nChannel the Saiyan God's power and deal <color=#E5C962>800% Damage</color> and stun per pulse!\n<color=#03f4fc>Extend the duration at the cost of </color><color=#03bcff>10 Ki per second!</color>",
        "God Fist Kamehameha": "God Fist Kamehameha",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>300 Ki</color>\nCharge and Unleash a God Kamehameha, Dealing <color=#E5C962>4000% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active! \nThen continuing with a God Fist, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1200% Damage</color> to each enemy hit!": "Costs <color=#03bcff>300 Ki</color>\nCharge and Unleash a God Kamehameha, Dealing <color=#E5C962>4000% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active! \nThen continuing with a God Fist, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1200% Damage</color> to each enemy hit!",
        "Godly Display": "Godly Display",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>400 Ki</color>\nrapidly teleport and strike all nearby enemies dealing <color=#E5C962>600% Damage</color>!\nFinishes off with a powerful roar dealing <color=#E5C962>2000% Damage</color> to all nearby enemies!\n<color=#03f4fc>The number of strikes increases based on attack speed</color>": "Costs <color=#03bcff>400 Ki</color>\nrapidly teleport and strike all nearby enemies dealing <color=#E5C962>600% Damage</color>!\nFinishes off with a powerful roar dealing <color=#E5C962>2000% Damage</color> to all nearby enemies!\n<color=#03f4fc>The number of strikes increases based on attack speed</color>",
        "Kamehameha x10": "Kamehameha x10",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>60 Ki</color>\nCharge and unleash a powerful Kamehameha x10, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1300% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active! \nConsume additional Ki and increase damage by <color=#E5C962>1400% Damage</color> per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>": "Costs <color=#03bcff>60 Ki</color>\nCharge and unleash a powerful Kamehameha x10, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1300% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active! \nConsume additional Ki and increase damage by <color=#E5C962>1400% Damage</color> per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>",
        "Black Kamehameha": "Black Kamehameha",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>70 Ki</color>\nCharge and unleash a godly Black Kamehameha, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1700% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active! \nConsume additional Ki and increase damage by <color=#E5C962>1000% Damage</color> per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>": "Costs <color=#03bcff>70 Ki</color>\nCharge and unleash a godly Black Kamehameha, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1700% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active! \nConsume additional Ki and increase damage by <color=#E5C962>1000% Damage</color> per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>",
        "White Dragon Fist": "White Dragon Fist",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>350 Ki</color>\nCharge forward and unleash a Fiery Dragon Fist, Dealing <color=#E5C962>4200% Damage</color> to every enemy hit!\n<color=#03f4fc>Deals bonus damage to low health targets!</color>": "Costs <color=#03bcff>350 Ki</color>\nCharge forward and unleash a Fiery Dragon Fist, Dealing <color=#E5C962>4200% Damage</color> to every enemy hit!\n<color=#03f4fc>Deals bonus damage to low health targets!</color>",
