        "KINGMOD_TUTORIAL_ZENKAI": "Gain Zenkai's by dying or staying below 20% health for 30 seconds. Grants permanent bonus stats.",
        "KINGMOD_TUTORIAL_LIGHT_CHARGE": "Gain Light Charge by hitting enemies with your sword. Once full, activate it by holding the Transformation Button. Grants bonus Damage and Crit Chance while active.",
        "KINGMOD_TUTORIAL_KAIOKEN": "Unlock Kaioken forms by levelling up your Base Form.\nArrows will display above the Kaioken Meter when Kaioken is available.\nTransform into Kaioken by holding the transformation button.\nWhile active, your body begins to Strain and fills the meter.\nIf the meter is full, you have a high chance of being stunned.\nLevelling up your Base Form increases your strain limit.\nHigher strain rates increase stun duration.\nMain Transformations require mastery to handle Kaioken.",
